# Sheet & modal a11y

Full audit: `detailing-app/docs/a11y-audit-phase2.md`

## Required on every new sheet/modal

1. **`role="dialog"`** + **`aria-modal="true"`**
2. **`aria-label`** — use `ariaLabel` prop or `title` (BottomSheet defaults to title)
3. **Escape** closes the overlay
4. **Focus trap** via `trapFocus()` from `@/lib/focus-trap`
5. **Initial focus** — close button (BottomSheet: `.inv-sheet-close`) or first focusable
6. **Body scroll lock** — `lockBodyScroll` / `unlockBodyScroll` (BottomSheet)
7. **Close control** — visible button with `aria-label="Close"`; overlay dismiss is a `<button>`, not a div

## BottomSheet (`src/components/BottomSheet.tsx`)

- Portal to `document.body`
- Drag handle is visual only — close button remains the primary dismiss affordance for keyboard/SR users
- Errors inside sheet body: `role="alert"` + `aria-live="assertive"`

## VaulSheet (`src/components/ui/VaulSheet.tsx`)

- Trap focus on `.vaul-body` ref when open
- `Drawer.Title` when `title` prop provided
- Use for pickers only — full forms use `BottomSheet`

## Tap targets

Minimum **44px** (`--tap-target-min` in tokens). Footer actions use `.sheet-submit` / `.btn-primary` patterns.

## Do not regress

- Skip link → `#main-content` in `AppShell.tsx`
- FAB menu: `role="menu"` / `menuitem`, focus trap, Escape
- Booking/auth errors: live regions (see `a11y-high-contrast.css`)
